<title>USA: Varian cancer treatment system gets FDA OK.</title>
<headline>Varian cancer treatment system gets FDA OK.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Varian Associates Inc said the Food and Drug Administration approved its CadPlan 3-Dimensional Treatment Planning System for cancer therapy. The system has been in use in other countries for more than 10 years and is currently used in 170 clinics around the world.</p>
<p>CadPlan produces precise computer scripts or electronic instructions that improve the efficacy of X-ray therapy.</p>
</text>
